lines+=['','## Interpretation and boundaries','', 'The full curve and caustic-focused interval are both reported: a large number of cheap epochs must not hide the remaining uniform/contact deficit. Derivative overhead is per whole curve and depends on its route mix. LD derivative overhead is not universally below30%. These are single-geometry timing examples; the seven-geometry matrix checks values/status/route coverage separately.','', 'Cold time is constructor plus first normal API call in a fresh engine process. It includes the actual continuous caustic-enclosure tree and support work, not a prebuilt plotting polyline. Nearby-source clearance and critical-phase enclosures are shared with the eventual integral support proof, following binary. Full plotting polylines have a separate explicit API and are not artificially added as a fictitious fixed cost. Changed-geometry times are single calls with s=1.0001 and are retained separately, not claimed as a robust isolated construction-time estimate.','', 'Every engine uses its own persistent subprocess and state; the parent sends requests serially in rotating/reversed order on CPU0. Warm medians use eight calls after two excluded calls. Timing inside each worker excludes imports, IPC and raw-result serialization. CPU frequency and external load are not controlled. No compilation or validation ran concurrently with these final timing series. VBM Tol=0 and RelTol=request implement the requested relative-only tolerance contract. Its current MultiMag2 corrquad<Tol gate cannot pass at Tol=0; this must not be described as VBM default settings.','', 'Incomplete support/continuation still refuses shortcuts or reports failure. Derivatives are not finite-difference implementations: frozen physical roots use the implicit lens equation, integral tangents are carried with their own scalar integration. Finite differences here are offline tests only. CTest and finite gradient flags do not constitute global scientific certification.','', '## Reproduction','', 'Build: cmake --build build-triple-native -j2 (Release, OpenMP OFF, JAX FFI OFF). Python: /home/nunota/.miniconda3/envs/myenv/bin/python. Tests: regression-final.log and ctest-final.log. Validate: OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 python evidence/triple_default_pipeline/validate_matrix.py. Benchmark sequentially: OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=1 OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 python evidence/triple_default_pipeline/interleaved.py ; then the same command with --wide. Use the recorded interpreter and preserve the editable-hook filter/verified build path in these scripts.','', 'before.diff and before-head.txt freeze the pre-existing work. before-patterson-stream.hpp preserves the earlier unrelated triple changes before this task modified its scalar error reduction. Source/header/native hashes, command and dirty identity are in provenance.json. No commit or push is part of this task.']
